  "description_text": "Rare 5-Bedroom Home in Prime Burlington Location Don't miss this rare opportunity to own a spacious 5 bedroom home ideally located near the University of Vermont and the University of Vermont Medical Center, with an easy walk to vibrant Winooski. Whether you're looking for a primary residence or a strong investment property, this home offers exceptional rental potential in a convenient location. Inside, you'll find five generously sized bedrooms and 2.5 baths, providing ample space and flexibility. The home features a welcoming layout with a great flow from the kitchen to the living room ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. This home also has a backyard with great exposure to natural light. Additional highlights include off-street parking and a garage, offering convenience and practicality. With its unbeatable location, spacious layout, and income potential, this property is a standout opportunity you won't want to miss.",
