  "description_text": "AVAILABLE JUNE 1, 2027! Welcome to 13 Peru Street in Burlington, VT - a charming, newly renovated 3-bedroom house in the heart of Downtown Burlington! This cozy two-level home combines classic Burlington character with updated finishes and modern conveniences. Inside, you'll find an inviting open living room with beautiful original hardwood floors throughout. The custom-built kitchen features new cabinets, countertops, and appliances, creating a fresh and functional space for cooking and entertaining. Step outside and enjoy a great front porch and fenced-in backyard, perfect for relaxing, BBQs, gardening, or spending time with your furry friends. The home is pet friendly ($)! You'll also have access to a basement for additional storage, along with the convenience of an in-unit washer and dryer. Property Highlights: 3 bedrooms Newly renovated Two-level single-family house Open living room Original hardwood floors Custom-built kitchen New cabinets, countertops & appliances Washer & dryer included Fenced-in backyard Front porch Basement storage Pet friendly ($) Residential parking available Conveniently located on the bus route 24-hour emergency maintenance Enjoy a fantastic Downtown Burlington location close to Church Street Marketplace, UVM, UVM Medical Center, Champlain College, the waterfront, restaurants, grocery stores, shopping, and more! Utilities: Tenants are responsible for all utilities, besides snow removal and lawn care. Please see the Leasing Information section of our website for additional utility information. Professionally managed by Bissonette Properties with 24-hour emergency maintenance for urgent maintenance needs. Available June 1, 2027 - apply today!",
